---
title: "S-IMPL-03 — Tambah Buku & Eksemplar (BukuController, LayananBuku)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Admin
    participant V as Vue 3 + Inertia<br/>Admin/Buku/Form.vue
    participant R as TambahBukuRequest<br/>(Gate kelola-buku)
    participant C as BukuController
    participant S as LayananBuku
    participant O as Eloquent<br/>Book, BookCopy, AuditLog
    participant DB as MySQL 8.4
    A->>V: Isi data bibliografi + daftar Kode Eksemplar
    V->>C: POST /admin/buku (CSRF, throttle 30/menit)
    C->>R: authorize() + rules()
    R-->>C: data valid (atau 403 / galat validasi)
    C->>S: tambah(isian, kodeEksemplar[], admin)
    alt Tidak ada eksemplar
        S-->>V: galat validasi — minimal satu eksemplar
    else ≥ 1 eksemplar
        rect rgb(235, 242, 255)
            Note over S,DB: DB::transaction (atomik)
            S->>O: Book::save()
            O->>DB: INSERT books
            S->>O: AuditLog buku.dibuat
            loop Setiap kode eksemplar
                S->>O: BookCopy::save() status Tersedia
                O->>DB: INSERT book_copies
                S->>O: AuditLog eksemplar.dibuat
            end
            alt Kode buku / eksemplar duplikat (1062)
                DB-->>S: galat unik → ROLLBACK
                S-->>V: galat validasi — galat duplikat
            else
                S->>DB: COMMIT
            end
        end
        C-->>V: 302 /admin/buku + flash sukses
    end
